    "source": {
      "other": "Whenever you finish an island, you will get bonus wares, depending on how many players have finished the island before you. The earlier you finish, the fewer wares you will get. See below for the details."
    },
    "target": {
      "other": "När du färdigställer en ö får du bonusvaror beroende på hur många spelare som blev klara före dig. Ju tidigare du blir klar, desto färre varor får du. Mer information finns nedan."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": null,
    "key": "Whenever you finish an island, you will get bonus wares, depending on how many players have finished the island before you. The earlier you finish, the fewer wares you will get. See below for the details.",
