  {
    "translation_id": "o:widelands:p:widelands:r:mp_scenario_island_hopping:s:baf68fb671cc94f33c251f75210b9c94:l:sv",
    "source_id": "o:widelands:p:widelands:r:mp_scenario_island_hopping:s:baf68fb671cc94f33c251f75210b9c94",
    "source": {
      "other": "Island Hopping is a traditional tournament in Atlantean culture. The rules of the game are simple: you start with a headquarters on an island. When you finish a castle at the end of the first island, you are granted a second headquarters on a second island, which will get all wares, workers and soldiers transferred from your headquarters and warehouses on the first island."
    },
    "target": {
      "other": "Ö-hoppning är en traditionell tävling i den atlantiska kulturen. Reglerna är enkla: du börjar med ett högkvarter på en ö. När du färdigställer ett slott längst ut på den första ön får du ett andra högkvarter på en andra ö. Dit flyttas alla varor, arbetare och soldater från högkvarteret och lagerbyggnaderna på den första ön."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": null,
    "key": "Island Hopping is a traditional tournament in Atlantean culture. The rules of the game are simple: you start with a headquarters on an island. When you finish a castle at the end of the first island, you are granted a second headquarters on a second island, which will get all wares, workers and soldiers transferred from your headquarters and warehouses on the first island.",
    "pluralized": false,
    "reviewed": false
  },
  {
