  {
    "translation_id": "o:widelands:p:widelands:r:mp_scenario_island_hopping:s:d55bc379981de89ebf148eef472f16da:l:sv",
    "source_id": "o:widelands:p:widelands:r:mp_scenario_island_hopping:s:d55bc379981de89ebf148eef472f16da",
    "source": {
      "other": "The point is that the first island only provides rocks and trees, the second only meadows and resources. The economies you leave behind will continue to work for you, but you will only reap the benefits at the moment you reach a new island."
    },
    "target": {
      "other": "Tanken är att den första ön bara ger klippor och träd, medan den andra bara ger ängar och resurser. Ekonomierna som du lämnar bakom dig fortsätter att arbeta för dig, men du får nytta av dem först när du når en ny ö."
    },
    "context": "",
    "developer_comment": null,
    "key": "The point is that the first island only provides rocks and trees, the second only meadows and resources. The economies you leave behind will continue to work for you, but you will only reap the benefits at the moment you reach a new island.",
    "pluralized": false,
    "reviewed": false
  },
